An offer—
  (a) of shares in or debentures of a company;
  (b) to persons who are qualifying persons in respect of the company referred to in paragraph (a) or of another company which is a member of the same group of companies as the company referred to in that paragraph;
  (c) by—
    (i) the company referred to in paragraph (a);
    (ii) another company which is a member of the same group of companies as the company referred to in paragraph (a); or
